/-! The 14/22 increment-shift loop creates the marker required by the
state-23 return scan. These are literal-table progress lemmas; they do not
yet identify the tape with a source graph configuration. -/
namespace Shared.Beeping.NPcoNP.NativeIncMarkerProgress
open Shared.Beeping Shared.Beeping.Machines PASoundness
open Shared.Beeping.NPcoNP.Table284
open Shared.Beeping.NPcoNP.NativeHalfScan
